      "end": 10,
      "text": "# 请假申请规定\n\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E2:S0",
      "evidence_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E2",
      "doc_id": "D04",
      "title": "请假申请规定 D04",
      "version_date": "2026-01-01",
      "start": 10,
      "end": 46,
      "text": "## 申请与审批\n\n请假须先在考勤系统提交申请，经直属主管审批后生效。\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E3:S0",
      "evidence_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E3",
      "doc_id": "D01",
      "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
      "version_date": "2026-01-01",
      "start": 59,
      "end": 122,
      "text": "## 二、提交期限\n\n1. 国内差旅报销须在行程结束后 30 天内提交。\n2. 报销申请的处理状态与上述提交期限分别记录。\n\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E4:S0",
      "evidence_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E4",
      "doc_id": "D02",
      "title": "差旅报销规定 D02",
      "version_date": "2026-01-01",
      "start": 59,
      "end": 122,
      "text": "## 二、提交期限\n\n1. 海外差旅报销须在行程结束后 15 天内提交。\n2. 报销申请的处理状态与上述提交期限分别记录。\n\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E5:S0",
      "evidence_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E5",
      "doc_id": "D01",
      "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
      "version_date": "2026-01-01",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 12,
      "text": "# 国内差旅报销规定\n\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E10:S0",
      "evidence_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E10",
      "doc_id": "D01",
      "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
      "version_date": "2026-01-01",
      "start": 12,
      "end": 59,
      "text": "## 一、用途与适用事项\n\n本规定说明员工国内差旅报销的提交期限，以及报销申请的处理状态。\n\n"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "e58bac346dcd4cde9054da5ff8dc94bf:E11:S0",
